    "description": "Happy Restaurant is a cooking game full of fun and challenges! Here, you can play as a chef or a waiter to provide customers with dishes! Join the game to unlock more dishes and create your premium restaurant!\r\n\r\nHow to play the game?\r\nWithin a limited time, quickly provide customers with the correct ingredients, ensure customer satisfaction to leave, and win the level after the coins reach a certain amount. Win levels, you can get stars to unlock more advanced restaurant decorations.\r\n\r\nGame features\r\n- Various upgrade elements! You can upgrade the restaurant's staff and facilities, order revenue, and customer patience, to improve work efficiency and revenue, which can help you pass the level.\r\n- Various magical props, such as \"acceleration shoes\" that increase the movement speed of the waiter, \"magic pot\" that immediately completes all current customer's orders, and \"locked props\" that freeze the customer's patience.\r\n- Rich and diverse activities, win generous rewards by participating in the activities.\r\n- Perfect achievement and honor system, achieve specific goals to unlock achievements, collect different customers, and win more coins and diamonds.\r\n-There are also different theme restaurants to keep your game fresh!\r\n\r\nDownload the game now, and let's build a fancy dream restaurant together!",
